Source: live responses from api.sleeper.app, fetched 2026-11-06.

Endpoints (all undocumented except /v1/state/**):
  /schedule/nfl/regular/2026
  /scores/nfl/regular/2026/9
  /teams/nfl
  /v1/state/nfl

These are trimmed copies of real payloads, not synthetic data. Fields the
client does not read were removed to keep the fixtures reviewable; no value
was edited. `scores_nfl_live.json` is the exception: it is the real completed
game from week 9 with its metadata flipped to an in-progress Q3 state, because
no NFL game was in progress at capture time. It exists to prove the live
decoder path, not to claim that a live update was observed.

Do not hand-edit these files. Recapture against the live endpoints and re-run
`xcodegen generate` if the shapes change.
